Description:It is your first main phase. You control Grizzly Bears and have Cragsmasher Yeti (4/2 trample; backup 2) in hand with six red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls an untapped Grizzly Bears. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-backup-grants-ability | Backup puts its counters on target creature and, if that is another creature, gives it the backup creature's abilities until end of turn (CR 702.165a): your Bears become a 4/4 trampler, enough even if blocked; backed up onto itself, the Yeti can't attack
